[_description]
Package: com.snowgears.shop.shop. AbstractShop.java base class for all shop types with full Javadoc on all methods.

[_does]
Manages shop state (ID, owner, item, price, stock), loads/saves shop data, calculates stock levels, updates sign displays, handles click actions, teleports players, manages GUI icons.

[_summary]
Abstract base class for all shop types in the Shop plugin. Defines core shop behavior including stock, price, ownership, persistence, and transaction execution.

[_careful]

[_careful/Compatibility]
setAdmin() should only be called before the shop is added to handler maps. Chunk loading is validated during loadFromSignAndChest(). Admin shops return Integer.MAX_VALUE for stock.

